  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -3.5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #29366f;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --border: #41a6f6;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font: 18px/1.5 system-ui, \"Courier New\", monospace;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n  padding: 24px;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000;\n}\n.field { display: grid; gap: 4px; }\nlabel { font-weight: 700; }\ninput, select, button, output {\n  font: inherit;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: #0f1020;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ffe9a8; }\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 #000;\n}\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: right;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  min-height: 56px;\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n  background: #0f1020;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 20px; }\n  output { font-size: 22px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const left = document.getElementById('left');\nconst right = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operation = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculate = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction parseNumber(value) {\n  const trimmed = value.trim();\n  if (trimmed === '') return NaN;\n  const n = Number(trimmed);\n  return Number.isFinite(n) ? n : NaN;\n}\n\nfunction compute(a, b, op) {\n  switch (op) {\n    case 'add': return a + b;\n    case 'subtract': return a - b;\n    case 'multiply': return a * b;\n    case 'divide': return b === 0 ? NaN : a / b;\n    default: return NaN;\n  }\n}\n\ncalculate.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const a = parseNumber(left.value);\n  const b = parseNumber(right.value);\n  const value = compute(a, b, operation.value);\n  result.textContent = Number.isFinite(value) ? String(value) : 'Error';\n});\n\n[left, right, operation].forEach(el => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') calculate.click();\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Two-Number Calculator\n\nA self-contained offline calculator with a pixel-art aesthetic. Built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — no packages, storage, or network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a **left** and **right** number (negative values supported).\n3. Choose an operation: add, subtract, multiply, or divide.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any field).\n5. The result appears in the output area. Invalid input or division by zero shows exactly `Error`.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Empty or non-finite inputs (NaN, Infinity) produce `Error`.\n- Division by zero produces `Error`.\n- Output contains only the numeric result — no labels.\n- Initial output is `0`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — semantic markup and accessible labeled controls.\n- `style.css` — pixel-style theme, responsive layout (works from 360px), hover/focus/pressed states.\n- `script.js` — validation and calculation logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls are keyboard-accessible with visible labels.\n- Focus outlines are clearly visible.\n- Layout remains usable at narrow widths.\n\n## Testing Notes\n\n- Verified empty inputs, non-finite values, division by zero, negative numbers, and all operations.\n- Confirmed keyboard navigation and focus states.\n- Checked responsive behavior at 360px width.\n- Total implementation stays under 200 lines.",
      "description": ""
    }
